    {
      "text": "Generative artworks and interactive environments by Brad Necyk.",
      "start": 1.83,
      "duration": 5.15
    },
    {
      "text": "A surface that answers. A fold in seeing. An unfinished sky. Impossible matter. A river remembering a drawing. Five encounters with the living physics of Cyberdelic OS.",
